    "description": "Learn to perform Exploratory Data Analysis on real-world data using Python Pandas. In this video, we demonstrate how to perform EDA on a dataset (Ozone Weather) with Pandas in Python. Under EDA, you will learn basic data understanding, data preparation, feature understanding (univariate analysis), feature relationships (bivariate and multivariate analysis), and data retrieval from DataFrame using different Pandas useful functions. We will use the following different functions\n\nJupyter Notebook and DataSet on Github: https://github.com/binary-study/data-science/tree/main/ExploratoryDataAnalysis\n\nYou can directly run the Notebook on Kaggle without needing to download the notebook and dataset.\n\nYou will learn the following in this video:\nWhat is EDA?\nStep 1: Basic Data Understanding\nStep 2: Data Preparation\nStep 3: Univariate Analysis (Feature Understanding )\nStep 4: Bivariate and Multivariate Analysis (Feature Relationships)\nStep 5: Ask Questions on Data?\n\n\nTimestamps:\n00:00 Intro\n02:25 What is EDA?\n02:50 Step 0: Data Loading\n04:00 Step 1: Basic Data Understanding\n08:14 Step 2: Data Preparation\n25:00 Step 3: Univariate Analysis (Feature Understanding )\n25:55 - Analyzing Categorical Features\n28:00 - Analyzing Numerical Features\n38:21 Step 4: Bivariate and Multivariate Analysis (Feature Relationships)\n38:49 - Numerical vs Numerical\n45:45 - Categorical vs Numerical\n47:35 - Date vs Numerical (Time series analysis)\n48:50 - Categorical vs Categorical (Crosstabs)\n50:00 - Grouped Statistics with .groupby()\n51:55 Step 5: Ask Questions on Data?\n58:20 Outro\n\nPython Videos\n1. https://youtu.be/Vbe2GaWGKgk\n2. https://youtu.be/yy9GEwkpMOM\n3. https://youtu.be/qxTrX6yc75s\n4. https://youtu.be/x8JjwRfIbN0\n\nComputer vision & image processing related videos:\n1. https://youtu.be/pBOfQTfDMVg\n2. https://youtu.be/uGPqnPwr1JY\n\nPlaylists\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLC5TQt3H5okgbSEhYJWmrH-eESzJSSHd9\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLC5TQt3H5okgoLM0M2spvyz7Is4YQ6iH3\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLC5TQt3H5okhKO_W-D2yaICQvl37Py70D\n\n#eda #python #exploratorydataanalysis #pandas #pythonpandas #datascienceprojects #datascience #machinelearning #dataanalytics #binarystudy"
